# MegaLinter gates TYPESCRIPT_PRETTIER + JSON_PRETTIER, i.e. .ts and .json only.
#
# This file is kept byte-identical in every prettier-using repo, so some entries
# are inert in some stacks: .angular/, test-results/ and playwright-report/ mean
# nothing in a backend, and vendor/ means nothing outside Go. One file to reason
# about beats eleven that drift. Do not "clean up" the entries per repo.
#
# *.html is excluded because reformatting Tailwind-heavy Angular templates is a
# large, separate change with no CI benefit. That is a frontend concern; the line
# is simply harmless where there are no templates.
*.html

node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.angular/
test-results/
playwright-report/
vendor/
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
